+    Tagging[Push tag vX.Y.Z] --> ReleaseWorkflow[release.yml]
+    ReleaseWorkflow --> Changelog[Generate CHANGELOG]
+    Changelog --> GitHubRelease[Create GitHub Release]
+    Merge[Merge to main] --> VersionBump[version-bump.yml]
+    VersionBump --> Tagging
+```
