+## 🧪 CI/CD Workflows
+
+### **1️⃣ Smoke Test – `shots-smoke.yml`**
+
+Runs on every push/PR to `main` or `shots-final`.
+
+**Steps:**
+
+- Install dependencies via `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`
+- Run:
+  ```bash
+  pnpm run shots:mock
+  pnpm run shots:report
+  pnpm run shots:zip
+  pnpm run shots:merge
+  ```
