+# AppMat High-Level Architecture
+
+AppMat is a hybrid mobile-first food ordering system built on:
+
+- Ionic + React
+- Supabase (auth, DB, RLS)
+- Supabase Edge Functions (payments, push)
+- Firebase FCM (push notifications)
+- Claude Sonnet 4.5 for model inference
+
+The architecture is fully modular and scalable.
